OL,3,GNEWSAFans walk to remember ex-Wolves
OL,4,Aboss Graham Taylor
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootball fans have embarked on a
OL,7,F270-mile challenge in honour of former
OL,8,Fclub and England manager Graham Taylor
OL,9,FOBE.
OL,11,FThe Taylor Trek Extreme saw the group
OL,12,Fset off on 23 September, to
OL,13,Fcollectively walk for 12 days along a
OL,14,Froute that connects four clubs he
OL,15,Fmanaged during his career.
OL,17,FOn Monday, they arrived at Molineux
OL,18,FStadium, the home of Wolverhampton
OL,19,FWanderers, where Taylor was at the helm
OL,20,Ffrom March 1994 until November 1995.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
