OL,3,GNEWSAFans walk to remember ex-Wolves
OL,4,Aboss Graham Taylor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe challenge started at Lincoln City.
OL,7,FAfter leaving Wolverhampton the walkers
OL,8,Fwill make their way to the grounds of
OL,9,FAston Villa and Wembley, before
OL,10,Farriving at Watford on 4 October.
